 terminate the transaction, and so the new terms\nare not adopted.\n14. A consumer purchases a camera system for home surveillance. At the same\ntime, the consumer enters a one-year service agreement that allows the consumer to stream\nthe images recorded by the camera to a handheld device through an integrated streaming\nservice separately provided by the business. The agreements include a modification\nprocedure. A few months later, the business sends the consumer a notice explaining that\nthe \"Terms of Service\" for the service agreement will be modified in 30 days, that\n78\n@§3\n"